|This=5

|content1=
* August 5th - '''Partizan Esports''' hire [[BAXACHA]] as their manager. <ref name="+BAXACHA">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1555602806857498626|title=PARTIZAN ESPORTS JOINS THE CS:GO SCENE!|date=2022-08-05|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 10th - '''Partizan Esports''' sign [[emi]]. <ref name="+emi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1557396746380140544|title=Operation “CS:GO” starts|date=2022-08-10|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''Partizan Esports''' sign [[c0llins]], [[ROGA]], [[sausol]] and [[KalubeR]] to complete their roster. <ref name="+roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1557760131361869839|title=Give a warm WELCOME to our CS:GO roster!|date=2022-08-11|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 21st - [[sausol]] is acquired by [[Movistar Riders]]. <ref name="-sausol">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1583528286009036800|title=𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗦𝗙𝗘𝗥 𝗨𝗣𝗗𝗔𝗧𝗘|date=2022-10-21|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 31st - '''Partizan Esports''' sign [[Duplicate]]. <ref name="+Duplicate">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1587167749163417600|title=𝗔𝗡𝗡𝗢𝗨𝗡𝗖𝗘𝗠𝗘𝗡𝗧|date=2022-10-31|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 12th - '''Partizan Esports''' sign [[Feed]] as their coach. <ref name="+Feed">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1624775711213989890|title=Time to conquer the Counter-Strike World|date=2023-02-12|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 11th - '''Partizan Esports''' transfer list their lineup amid financial difficulties. <ref name="roster benched">{{cite web|url=https://partizanesports.com/partizan-csgo-roster-update/|title=Partizan CS:GO roster update|date=2023-04-11|publisher='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 25th - [[emi]] and [[ROGA]] are acquired by [[TYLOO]]. <ref name="-emi -ROGA">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/1767969392/N2f2E4WQb|title=TYLOO电子竞技俱乐部CSGO分部人员变动公告|language={{Flag|cn}} Chinese|trans_title=TYLOO e-sports club CSGO branch personnel change announcement|date=2023-05-25|author=[[TYLOO]]}}</ref>
* July 1st - '''Partizan Esports''' release [[c0llins]], [[KalubeR]], [[Duplicate]] and [[Feed]] upon the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="July 1, 2023">{{inside source|date=2023-07-11|source=Duplicate}}</ref>
* July 10th - '''Partizan Esports''' announce their new roster consisting of [[baxter]], [[RiiL3]], [[LeO]], [[xavi]] and [[Consume]]. <ref name="+roster 2023">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/esportspartizan/status/1678393264062316547|title=PARTIZAN IS BACK IN COUNTER STRIKE|date=2023-07-10|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 30th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="-roster 2023">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/riil3cs/status/1719099834676740390|title=After unfortunate events with Partizan, I'm actively searching for a team to join full-time as an AWPer|date=2023-10-30|author=[[RiiL3]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* June 12th - '''Partizan Esports''' return to ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a roster consisting of [[Dragon]], [[emi]], [[c0llins]], [[Kind0]] and [[ROGA]]. <ref name="Partizan 2024">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1800956388476354718|title=PARTIZAN ESPORTS CS TEAM IS BACK!|date=2024-06-12|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 21st - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[soLo]] and rehire [[BAXACHA]] as manager. <ref name="-solo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1859651290701222119|title=THANK YOU SOLO!|date=2024-11-21|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="hire baxacha">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1859663461606928418|title=WELCOME HOME!|date=2024-11-21|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 15th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[ROGA]] and sign [[VLDN]] as his replacement. <ref name="-ROGA">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1879577043861651846|title=Unfortunately, there comes a time when we have to say goodbye to open doors to new beginnings|date=2025-01-15|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+vldn">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1879624706887938468|title=BOOM!|date=2025-01-15|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* February 14th - '''Partizan Esports''' sign [[choiv7]] as coach on a trial basis. <ref name="+choiv7">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1890401185175117886|title=Starting today, the men's team of Partizan Esports has a new coach!|date=2025-02-14|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* March 18th - [[VLDN]] signs a multi-year contract extension with '''Partizan Esports'''. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1902037827094794691|title=We are proud to announce that Vladan @vldnCS Radević has signed a new multi-year contract with Partizan Esports!|date=2025-03-18|author='''Partizan Esports'''}} </ref>
* May 5th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[choiv7]] after his trial contract expires. <ref name="-choiv7">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1919470253794566409|title=Unfortunately, Ivan “@choiv7cs” Živković is no longer the coach of Partizan Esports|date=2025-05-05|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 8th - '''Partizan Esports''' promote [[BAXACHA]] to a main coaching role. <ref name="baxacha coach">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1920516625905668166|title=A familiar face, well known to everyone and with us since the very beginning — Dejan “Baxacha” Atanacković — is officially taking on the role of head coach|date=2025-05-08|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 17th - '''Partizan Esports''' add [[DEPRESHN]] on a trial basis. <ref name="DEPRESHN trial">{{inside source|source=DEPRESHN |date=2025-07-19}}</ref>
* May 18th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[emi]]. <ref name="-emi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1924061974083633371|title=Thank you, Emi|date=2025-05-18|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 30th - '''Patizan Esports''' transfer list their roster. <ref name="-partizan 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/baxacha_/status/1950545042541572182|title=Official Statement|date=2025-07-30|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 11th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[DEPRESHN]] and add [[aidKiT]] on a trial basis as his replacement. <ref name="-depreshn +aidkit trial">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1966208840372039987|title=THANK YOU FILIP|date=2025-09-11|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''Partizan Esports''' add [[nopzy]] on a trial basis as [[c0llins]] steps down from the active lineup. <ref name="nopzy trial">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/baxacha_/status/1972359591301206313|title=@c0llinsCS decided to take a break from active playing|date=2025-09-28|author=[[BAXACHA]]}}</ref>
* October 27th - '''Partizan Esports''' loan [[Dragon]] to [[Metizport]] until the end of the year. <ref name="dragon loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/1982886559750975850|title=THANK YOU, NIKOLA!|date=2025-10-27|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 12th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[nopzy]]. <ref name="-nopzy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nopzyCS/status/1988660192096219376|title=LFT POST|date=2025-11-12|author=[[nopzy]]}}</ref>
* December 29th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[aidKiT]] while [[VLDN]] steps down from the active roster due to personal reasons. <ref name="-aidkit">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/aidKiT_CS/status/2005629931120656387|title=LFT|date=2025-12-29|author=[[aidKiT]]}}</ref><ref name="vldn inactive">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/vldnCS/status/2005710707124494540|title=I’ve decided to bench myself at Partizan Esports for personal reasons, and they've allowed me to pursue other oportunities|date=2025-12-29|author=[[VLDN]]}}</ref>
* December 30th - [[Dragon]] is acquired by [[Metizport]]. <ref name="-dragon">{{cite web|url=https://metizport.com/dragon-joins-metizport-on-permanent-basis|title=Dragon joins Metizport on permanent basis|date=2025-12-30|publisher=[[Metizport]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 4th - '''Partizan Esports''' bench [[Kind0]]. <ref name="kind0 inactive">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Kind0csgo/status/2007834227681923343|title=Hey everyone!|date=2026-01-04|author=[[Kind0]]}}</ref>
* February 9th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[VLDN]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="-vldn">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/vldnCS/status/2020957580701597882|title=Decided to mutually part ways with @esportspartizan and now i am a free agent looking to grind with a new team|date=2026-02-09|author=[[VLDN]]}}</ref>
* March 6th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[Kind0]]. <ref name="-Kind0">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Kind0csgo/status/2029947018341183860|title=Officially a FREE AGENT now|date=2026-03-06|author=[[Kind0]]}}</ref>
* March 26th - '''Partizan Esports''' announce their new roster consisting of [[m1traa]], [[zecco]], [[DotlA]], [[rajkeza]], and [[dyrod]]. <ref name="+roster 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/esportspartizan/status/2037243256396812724|title=A new chapter begins|date=2026-03-26|author='''Partizan Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 12th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[c0llins]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-c0llins">{{inside source|source=c0llins}}</ref>
* August 24th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[m1traa]]. <ref name="-m1traa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/m1traa1/status/2091838343243833596|title=Hey My time with Partizan has officially come to an end|date=2026-08-24|author=[[m1traa]]}}</ref>
* September 16th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[rajkeza]]. <ref name="-rajkeza">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/rajkezaaa/status/2100326677897171140|title=LFT|date=2026-09-16|author=[[rajkeza]]}}</ref>
* September 18th - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[zecco]]. <ref name="-zecco">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zecco_/status/2100948794850386382|title=LFT|date=2026-09-18|author=[[zecco]]}}</ref>
* September 22nd - '''Partizan Esports''' part ways with [[BAXACHA]]. <ref name="-BAXACHA">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/baxacha_/status/2102407534191481107|title=Now that my time with Partizan Esports has officially come to an end, I’m ready for a new challenge|date=2026-09-22|author=[[BAXACHA]]}}</ref>
* September 28th - [[dyrod]] is acquired by [[Copenhagen Wolves (American organization)|Copenhagen Wolves]]. <ref name="-dyrod">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/CPHWolves/status/2104628675908153524|title=Counter-Strike. We are BACK|date=2026-09-28|author=[[Copenhagen Wolves (American organization)|Copenhagen Wolves]]}}</ref>
}}

