'''Permitta Esports''' is a [[:Category:Switzerland|Swiss]] professional esports organization founded in April 2022.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2022
|name2=2023
|name3=2024
|name4=2025
|name5=2026
|This=5

|content1=
* November 3rd - '''Permitta Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' by signing the lineup of [[PALOMA]] consisting of: [[olimp]], [[sNx]], [[Layner]], [[iso]], [[casey]], and [[turtle]] as the coach. <ref name="Permitta 2022">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Permittaesports/status/1588214423021395973|title=Hello @paloma_csgo fans!|author='''Permitta Esports'''|date=2022-11-03}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 28th - '''Permitta Esports''' release their lineup. <ref name="disband 2023">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Permittaesports/status/1629119309069910016|title=We would like to announce that as of the end of this month, the partnership with the current CS:GO squad is terminated|author='''Permitta Esports'''|date=2023-02-24}}</ref>
* September 12th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[nowik]]. <ref name="-nowik">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/nowik_cs/status/1701567496162099504|title=As of today I am ending my cooperation with @Permittaesports|author=[[nowik]]|date=2023-09-12}}</ref>
* October 8th - '''Permitta Esports''' sign [[los kogutos]], a roster consisting of: [[tomiko]], [[Enzo]], [[maaryy]], [[hotd0g]] and [[EXUS]]. <ref name="October 2023">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Permittaesports/status/1711056335075246184|title=!Big News!|author='''Permitta Esports'''|date=2023-10-08}}</ref>
* November 1st - '''Permitta Esports''' sign [[darchevile]]. <ref name="+darchevile">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/los_kogutos/status/1719807902012064072|title=Pierwszy film był tak dobry, że postanowiliśmy zrobić sequel|trans_title=The first film was so good that we decided to make a sequel|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2023-11-01|author=[[los kogutos]]}}</ref>
* November 3rd - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[Enzo]] and [[EXUS]] and add [[KukuBambo]] on trial. <ref name="kukubambo trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/los_kogutos/status/1720481599513358499|title=2:0 vs @PACT_gg, -enzo -exus +kukubambo (trial)|date=2023-11-03|author=[[los kogutos]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 1st - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-2022 roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Permittaesports/status/1742271315665473672|title=!Counter Strike News! |date=2024-01-02|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* January 4th - '''Permitta Esports''' sign a new roster consisting of [[maaryy]], [[morelz]], [[bnox]], [[Vegi]], [[mASKED]], and [[Sidney]], the latter as coach. <ref name="+2024 roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Permittaesports/status/1743007001741873492|title=!Exciting News!|date=2024-01-04|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 31st - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[Vegi]] and acquire [[tomiko]] on loan from [[9INE Academy]]. <ref name="-Vegi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1796482223681450403|title=It's time to say goodbye!|date=2024-05-31|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+tomiko">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1796527226185462147|title=!Big comeback!|date=2024-05-31|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref> 
* June 5th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[morelz]]. <ref name="-morelz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/permittaesports/status/1798294166750777551|title=It's time to say goodbye to another legend!|date=2024-06-05|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 6th - '''Permitta Esports''' acquire [[SpavaQ]] from [[AVEZ]]. <ref name="+SpavaQ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1798701917226614846|title=New partner and of course new player!|date=2024-06-06|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 26th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[SpavaQ]]. <ref name="-SpavaQ">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1828020816673378565|title=As of today we announce that with the end of the contract we part ways with @SpavaQQ|date=2024-08-26|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref> 
* September 28th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[Sidney]]. <ref name="-sidney">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1840058890693529626|title=By mutual agreement of two parties, today we say goodbye to our coach @Sidney_csgo|date=2024-09-28|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 26th - '''Permitta Esports''' bench and transfer-list their roster. As a result, [[tomiko]]'s loan is terminated and he returns to [[9INE Academy]]'s bench. <ref name="-permitta 2024">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/permittaesports/status/1861411644015866317|title=Everything what's good has to come to the end|date=2024-11-26|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[maaryy]], [[bnox]], and [[mASKED]] following the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="-maaryy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/maaryyycs/status/1861431691207655806|title=My contract with Permitta expires in the last day of 2024, and I'm looking for a new opportunities where I can continue my career|date=2024-11-26|author=[[maaryy]]}}</ref><ref name="-bnox">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bnoxcs/status/1861444681239793762|title=I am sitting on the bench in Permitta until my contract expires by the end of this year so at the moment I am looking for a new project for next season|date=2024-11-26|author=[[bnox]]}}</ref><ref name="-mASKED">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/maskedcs/status/1861412901405249873|title=I’m looking for a new project as an IGL for a 2025 season as my contract with Permitta expires within the end of 2024|date=2024-11-26|author=[[mASKED]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 21st - '''Permitta Esports''' sign a new lineup consisting of [[Twiksar]], [[Kre1N]], [[Tionix]], [[Orbit (Austrian player)|Orbit]], and [[fostar]]. <ref name="+arrow">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1881771243034259816|title=It’s time to turn the page and begin a new chapter!|date=2025-01-21|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 15th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-permitta 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1912174082046521787|title=After a few months with our current CS main roster, we've made the decision to part ways and terminate the players' contracts|date=2025-04-15|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 10th - '''Permitta Esports''' promote their [[Permitta UA|Ukrainian squad]]. <ref name="+permitta ua 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1954499689698509240|title=We are excited to announce that our UA team is officially joining the main Permitta roster!|date=2025-08-05|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 1st - '''Permitta Esports'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster is acquired by [[ENOSIS eSports]]. <ref name="-permitta ua 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1962530928598651376|title=Unfortunately we need to announce the transfer of our main CS2 roster to @EnosisCR |date=2025-09-01|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 9th - '''Permitta Esports''' sign [[ex-Infernal Void]], a roster consisting of [[olivR]], [[ar1don]], [[kzy]], [[n1xara]], and [[kamikadze]]. <ref name="+infernal void">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1965508137601171928|title=The new story begins...|date=2025-09-09|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 13th - '''Permitta Esports''' sign [[Byfield]]. <ref name="+byfield">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/1989003969994076529|title=Matchday? Yes. Announcement day? Also.|date=2025-11-13|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 20th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with [[n1xara]]. <ref name="-n1xara">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/N1xaraCS2/status/1991555188424073399|title=LFT – Free Agent|date=2025-11-20|author=[[n1xara]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* February 28th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with their roster as [[olivR]], [[ar1don]], and [[kamikadze]] are acquired by [[OTHERSCANTBEAT]]. <ref name="-2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/OTHERSCANTBEAT/status/2027700761564532737|title=Time to go back to the roots.|date=2026-02-28|author=[[OTHERSCANTBEAT]]}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''Permitta Esports''' sign a new lineup consisting of [[AdrieN]], [[Markoś]], [[maaryy]], [[tomiko]], [[showk]], and [[pako]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="+2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Permittaesports/status/2087827405532549364|title=Los Kogutos are coming home!|date=2026-08-13|author='''Permitta Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 24th - '''Permitta Esports''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-pl 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1masashii/status/2103003031360979149|title=Today at 15:00, we’re playing the ESL Challenger Cup semi-final against LPH|date=2026-09-24|author=[[:brawlstars:masashii|masashii]]}}</ref>
}}

