'''Phoenix''' (formerly known as '''ex-Epsilon Esports''') was an orgless [[:Category:Europe|European]] ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team. It was formed after [[Epsilon Esports]] parted ways with their ''CS:GO'' team.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2019
|name2=2020
|This=2

|content1=
*July 24th - '''ex-Epsilon Esports''' forms after [[Epsilon Esports]] parted ways with its CS:GO team. <ref name="Eps">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SPELLANCSGO/status/1154064943781752832|date=2019-07-24|title=We will no longer be part of @Epsilon_eSports , thanks for the opportunity!|author=[[SPELLAN]]}}</ref>
*August 12th - '''ex-Epsilon Esports''' part ways with [[kreaz]]. <ref name="-kreaz">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/kreazCS/status/1160971453128433664|title=I'm no longer part of ex-Epsilon.|date=2019-08-12 |author=[[kreaz]]}}</ref>
*August 17th - '''ex-Epsilon Esports''' add [[nk4y]] on trial. <ref name="nk4y trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SPELLANCSGO/status/1162685379838955520|title=Today we are announcing our new 5th player!|date=2019-08-17|author=[[SPELLAN]]}}</ref>
*September 8th - [[broky]] leaves '''ex-Epsilon Esports''', [[v1c7oR]] joins as a stand-in. <ref name="+v1c7oR">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/27808|title=broky leaves ex-Epsilon|date=2019-09-08|author=[[LucasAM]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*September 10th - [[BARBARR]] joins '''ex-Epsilon Esports''' as the team's coach, [[DroW]] becomes the team's analyst. <ref name="+BARBAR">{{inside source|date=2019-09-10|lp-date=2019-09-29|source=BARBARR|source-role=Coach|lp=source=mnmzzz}}</ref>
*October 2nd - [[Thomas]] joins '''ex-Epsilon Esports''' on trial, replacing [[v1c7oR]]. <ref name="Thomas trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SPELLANCSGO/status/1179513899009347584|title=From today we will play with Thomas instead of v1c7oR for the long term.|date=2019-10-02|author=[[SPELLAN]]}}</ref>
*October 6th - [[DroW]] leaves '''ex-Epsilon Esports'''. <ref name="-DroW">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/drowzcs/status/1180834758101786624|title=We have had quite a journey with the boys and i`m proud of what we built so far. I`ve decided to take a break from CS and focus on other things.|date=2019-10-06|author=[[DroW]]}}</ref>
*October 8th - [[BARBARR]] leaves '''ex-Epsilon Esports'''. [[SamE]] takes over coaching duties <ref name="-BARBAR">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BARBARRcs/status/1181612882796134400|title=Was a pleasure working with the ex-epsilon guys for the last month|date=2019-10-08|author=[[BARBARR]]}}</ref><ref name="SamE coach">{{inside source}}</ref>
*October 9th - The team renames to '''Phoenix''' and remove [[nk4y]]. <ref name="-nk4y">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/28109|title=ex-Epsilon part ways with NK4Y; to rebrand to Phoenix|date=2019-10-09|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*October 11th - [[Thomas]] completes his trial and joins the team as a full member. <ref name="Thomas perm">{{inside source}}</ref>
*October 12th - [[juanflatroo]] joins '''Phoenix''' on a trial basis. <ref name=juan trial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SPELLANCSGO/status/1183098230118273027|title=Im happy to announce that @juanflatroo will be joining our team on trial basis.|date=2019-10-12|author=[[SPELLAN]]}}</ref>
*October 24th - [[SPELLAN]] leaves '''Phoenix'''. <ref name="-SPELLAN">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sr1urn|title=Leaving Phoenix|date=2019-10-24|author=[[SPELLAN]]}}</ref>
*November 7th - [[juanflatroo]] leaves '''Phoenix'''. <ref name="-juan">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ThomasCS__/status/1192561396606746629|title=Well as the MDL season comes to a close @juanflatroo will be leaving us...|date=2019-11-07|author=[[Thomas]]}}</ref>
*November 25th - [[SamE]] leaves '''Phoenix''' to become [[Team Secret]]'s manager. <ref name="-SamE">{{cite web|url=https://teamsecret.gg/2019/11/25/introducing-team-secret-csgo/|date=2019-11-25|title=Introducing Team Secret CS:GO|publisher=[[Team Secret]]}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 14th - '''Phoenix''' is acquired by [[Team Endpoint]]. <ref name="-End">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamEndpoint/status/1217116343562133505|title=Surreal, CRUC1AL and Thomas leave Phoenix for Team Endpoint.|date=2020-01-14|author=[[Team Endpoint]]}}</ref>
