'''Prestige Esport''' is a [[:category:Denmark|Danish]] professional esports organization founded in late 2024 via the merger of the original [[Prestige Esport (Danish Organization)|Prestige Esport]], [[Floki Esport]], and [[AUC Tigers]]. <ref name="Prestige founded"/>

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3
|content1=
* December 2nd -  '''Prestige Esport''' is founded with a roster consisting of [[NickyB]], [[Shadow Eagle]], [[GA1De]], [[ItzNima]], [[Mizi]], and [[dox (Danish player)|dox]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="Prestige founded">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Onhold_11/status/1863681037655527820|date=2024-12-02|title=En ny æra for dansk esport!|trans_title=A new era for Danish esports! |language={{flag|dk}} Danish|author='''Prestige Esport'''}}</ref>
|content2=
